<title>UK: Wuerttemburgische Hypo adds 500 mln marks to bond.</title>
<headline>Wuerttemburgische Hypo adds 500 mln marks to bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond, announced by joint lead managers Deutsche Bank, Bayerische Hypothekenbank and Dresdner Bank has been increased by 500 million marks.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WUERTTEMBURGISCHE HYPOTHEKENBANK</p>
<p> AMT    *2.5 BLN DEM  COUPON     5.0 PCT   MATURITY    12.NOV.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.305   PAY DATE  **22.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.275     REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	 =</p>
<p> NOTES	*ORIGINAL 2.0 BLN DEM LAUNCHED 15.JAN.96</p>
<p>	     **PLUS ACCRUED INTEREST</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    STG	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.06	SELL CONC  0.215     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	OEFFENTLICHE PFANDBRIEF</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
